 "A sequence among the three judgments. Each is placed before the kingdom opens; the order 6, 7, 8 is the map’s own.",
 "The length of anything. Scripture gives seven months and seven years for the cleansing and a thousand years for the kingdom; it gives no length for the wars or the judgments.",
 "Who “all the saints” of Zechariah 14:5 and the armies of Revelation 19:14 are. The map does not place the Body among them.",
 "That the Gog of Ezekiel 38–39 is the Armageddon gathering.",
 "What fills the extra 30 and 75 days of Daniel 12:11–12.",
 "That Joel’s valley of Jehoshaphat is the place of Matthew 25. The map joins them and marks that as its reading.",
